    "text_with_icons_bTUQpT": {
      "type": "text-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "item_nVdCGz": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-coupon",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/transparent-graphic-element.png",
            "mobile_icon_width": 24,
            "icon_width": 24,
            "icon_background_type": "none",
            "icon_background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>To anyone interested in joining LifePharm, try the products! Just try them—there’s no risk! Once you experience the results, you’ll want to share them, and when you do your journey to financial freedom will begin. After I researched the products and tried them for myself, I naturally started to share them. Then I started sharing other testimonials on these amazing products that I found on the internet. After awhile, I realized how much money LifePharm pays out—much more than other network marketing companies! My LifePharm Business earnings have enabled me to pay off debts, buy a new car, purchase a destination home.\" </p><p> </p><p>- Michael B.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_x3DehJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-coupon",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/transparent-graphic-element.png",
            "mobile_icon_width": 24,
            "icon_width": 24,
            "icon_background_type": "circle",
            "icon_background": "",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>Since joining LifePharm, I’ve worked consistently and passionately. The journey has been empowering, not just financially, but personally. One of the most amazing milestones? I recently bought a brand-new electric vehicle — something I never imagined was possible when I first started. To anyone just starting out: LifePharm works. The products are powerful, the opportunity is real, and if you stay consistent and believe in what you're doing, success will follow. I’m living proof of that.\"</p><p> </p><p>- Robin F.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Y6VbWc": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-coupon",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/transparent-graphic-element.png",
            "mobile_icon_width": 24,
            "icon_width": 24,
            "icon_background_type": "circle",
            "icon_background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>“I work my LifePharm business during my free time. In five months, my earnings with LifePharm are already higher than from my regular job. I really like the LifePharm Compensation Plan, because it’s simple, efficient and pays well. I believe anyone can climb up the ranks simply by using the products daily and telling everyone about their benefits of producing overall well-being, youthful appearance, improved energy levels and cheerfulness\"</p><p><br/><br/>- Anna W.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_VnrpBW": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-coupon",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/transparent-graphic-element.png",
            "mobile_icon_width": 24,
            "icon_width": 24,
            "icon_background_type": "circle",
            "icon_background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>“It is very easy to become successful and prosperous with LifePharm. Simply use the product, tell about your results to the greatest number of people possible and believe in yourself, the company and its success. Based on my 20 years of personal experience, I can recommend LifePharm to everyone who cares about health and financial stability.”</p><p><br/><br/>- Anatoly I.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kfgt3g": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-coupon",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/transparent-graphic-element.png",
            "mobile_icon_width": 24,
            "icon_width": 24,
            "icon_background_type": "circle",
            "icon_background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>“I want to help enable countless women to build  their own livelihoods with LifePharm and enjoy  earning residual income the same way I do — something that was new to me. In doing so, I’m also able to earn a substantial income.\"</p><p><br/><br/>- Slawomira G.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_nVdCGz",
        "item_x3DehJ",
        "item_Y6VbWc",
        "item_VnrpBW",
        "item_kfgt3g"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".text-with-icons__item {padding: 25px 32px !important; background: #fff4e5; margin: 0 20px !important; border-radius: 10px; border-width: 1px;}",
        ".h5 {font-weight: 700; align-content: flex-start; max-width: 245px; margin: auto;}",
        "img {display: inline; margin: 20px 0 10px;}",
        "@media (min-width: 769px) {.text-with-icons__item {min-height: 200px; } {padding-left: 90px; padding-right: 90px; }}",
        "@media (min-width: 1150px) {.text-with-icons__list {--text-with-icons-template: auto-flow 100% !important; }}"
      ],
      "name": "Text with icons",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": false,
        "stack_on_mobile": false,
        "title": "",
        "heading_tag": "h5",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "icon_spacing": "small",
